n.prod.website-files.com/6751e31f9aaa082b0f7234ec/69cd7d4e99212b1898892ffb_IMG_9562%20(2)-p-1600.avif 1600w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6751e31f9aaa082b0f7234ec/69cd7d4e99212b1898892ffb_IMG_9562%20(2)-p-2000.avif 2000w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6751e31f9aaa082b0f7234ec/69cd7d4e99212b1898892ffb_IMG_9562%20(2)-p-2600.avif 2600w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6751e31f9aaa082b0f7234ec/69cd7d4e99212b1898892ffb_IMG_9562%20(2)-p-3200.avif 3200w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6751e31f9aaa082b0f7234ec/69cd7d4e99212b1898892ffb_IMG_9562%20(2).avif 5665w\" class=\"hero-img-right u-image-shrink\"/></div></div></div></section><section color-mode=\"\" class=\"intro_scroll_subpage-section-container u-vflex-center-center\"><div data-padding-bottom=\"large\" data-padding-top=\"large\" class=\"intro_scroll_subpage-content-container u-columns-12 workbooks-page\"><div class=\"section_intro-center-aligned\"><div class=\"section_intro-section-label\"><div class=\"u-text-section-label u-text-align-center\">WHY COMMONLIT</div></div><div class=\"section_intro-title\"><h2 class=\"u-text-h2 u-text-align-center\">More than a text library</h2></div><div class=\"section-subhead\"><p class=\"u-text-large u-text-align-center\">Browse thousands of texts today, teach complete ELA units, and bring in support when your school is ready.</p></div></div><div class=\"intro_scroll_subpage-feature-column-3\"><div class=\"intro_scroll_subpage-scroll-feature\"><div class=\"intro_scroll_subpage-feature_illustration-container-integrations-copy\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6751e31f9aaa082b0f7234ec/678864a0ee5d279b0cc80b76_CL-intro-scroll-3%403x.png\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" class=\"intro_scroll_subpage-feature-img-copy\"/></div><div class=\"intro_scroll_subpage-feature-content\"><p class=\"u-text-h3 u-text-family-secondary intro_scroll_subpage-features_scroll_title mobile-h3-override\">Full units &amp; novel studies, all free</p><div class=\"u-text-medium intro_scroll_subpage-feature-body\">Teachers get access to thousands of high-quality, accessible texts, full-length book pairings, and the complete CommonLit 360 curriculum. It’s free for teachers, always.</div></div></div><div class=\"intro_scroll_subpage-scroll-feature\"><div class=\"intro_scroll_subpage-feature_illustration-container\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6751e31f9aaa082b0f7234ec/678864a01dded3938bfdcd2a_CL-intro-scroll-4%403x.png\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" class=\"intro_scroll_subpage-feature-img\"/></div><div class=\"intro_scroll_subpage-feature-content\"><p class=\"u-text-h3 u-text-family-secondary intro_scroll_subpage-features_scroll_title mobile-h3-override\">Get every class on the same page</p><h4 class=\"heading-44\">Build Lasting Change</h4><div class=\"u-text-medium intro_scroll_subpage-feature-body\">We offer your ELA teachers one shared curriculum <em>and </em>the support to use it well. That includes on-site and virtual PD and implementation support across the year. </div></div></div><div class=\"intro_scroll_subpage-scroll-feature\"><div class=\"intro_scroll_subpage-feature_illustration-container\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6751e31f9aaa082b0f7234ec/678864a0b4a148ddca5a9bb3_CL-intro-scroll-2%403x.png\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" class=\"intro_scroll_subpage-feature-img\"/></div><div class=\"intro_scroll_subpage-feature-content\"><p class=\"u-text-h3 u-text-family-secondary intro_scroll_subpage-features_scroll_title mobile-h3-override\"><strong>Backed by people who care</strong></p><h4 class=\"heading-44\">Maximize Curriculum Impact</h4><div class=\"u-text-medium intro_scroll_subpage-feature-body\">At CommonLit, former teachers write the curriculum, lead the training, and shape what we build. We believe in technology that serves teachers, and never replaces them.</div></div></div></div></div></section><div class=\"waves---section-medium-4\"><section class=\"section-5\"><div class=\"w-layout-blockcontainer w-container\"><div class=\"u-text-section-label u-text-align-center\">for ELA teams</div><h2 class=\"u-text-h2 u-text-align-center\">Everything you need in one place</h2><div class=\"u-text-large teacher-experience\">Schools succeed when materials, vision, support, and data come together. We provide all four in one affordable ELA program.</div></div></section><div class=\"waves---main-container-3 w-container\"><div class=\"w-layout-grid waves---grid-image-halves\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6751e31f9aaa082b0f7234ec/6a342bdc0c3c5dc73d442443_Unit%201%20Abstraction.png\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Unit 1 The Art of Suspense for Grade 8 with lessons on writing, reading, and media exploration times.\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 48vw, (max-width: 991px) 356px, 462px\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6751e31f9aaa082b0f7234ec/6a342bdc0c3c5dc73d442443_Unit%201%20Abstraction-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6751e31f9aaa082b0f7234ec/6a342bdc0c3c5dc73d442443_Unit%201%20Abstraction-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6751e31f9aaa082b0f7234ec/6a342bdc0c3c5dc73d442443_Unit%201%20Abstraction-p-1080.png 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6751e31f9aaa082b0f7234ec/6a342bdc0c3c5dc73d442443_Unit%201%20Abstraction.png 1270w\" class=\"image-33 waves-image-features-10\"/><div id=\"w-node-d642ff56-cf6c-3f2c-283a-aa0b6a7c8247-6a7c823e\" class=\"waves---content-image-halves\"><h3 class=\"u-text-family-secondary\">High-quality instructional materials</h3><div class=\"u-text-large u-text-align-left\">Our ELA curriculum for grades 6-12 is aligned to state standards and built around full-length texts. Teachers get print and digital lessons to make it their own.</div><a data-wf-native-id-path=\"9576a00d-4b8c-ab0f-e728-993dae497600:6bcc5356-b2bd-15ca-754c-bac899a12e9c\" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking=\"true\" data-wf-element-id=\"6bcc5356-b2bd-15ca-754c-bac899a12e9c\" data-wf-component-context=\"%5B%7B%22componentId%22%3A%22d642ff56-cf6c-3f2c-283a-aa0b6a7c823e%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%229576a00d-4b8c-ab0f-e728-993dae497600%22%7D%5D\" href=\"/ela-curriculum\" class=\"button w-button\">Learn more</a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"waves---section-medium-7\"><div class=\"waves---main-container-7 w-container\"><div class=\"w-layout-grid waves---grid-image-halves-4\"><div id=\"w-node-_76c0c8f4-8bff-d129-d3fc-e00cc981851d-c981851a\" class=\"waves---content-image-halves-4\"><h3 class=\"u-text-family-secondary\">Implementation support built to last</h3><div><div class=\"u-text-align-left u-text-large\">We guide your school step by step, from launch day through the whole year. Our team helps leaders plan, spot problems early, and keep teachers aligned.</div><a data-wf-native-id-path=\"81c36707-403c-b927-25d3-58678d90ccb1:f345493b-3571-3e3a-1eb9-34eb4125cb72\" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking=\"true\" data-wf-element-id=\"f345493b-3571-3e3a-1eb9-34eb4125cb72\" data-wf-component-context=\"%5B%7B%22componentId%22%3A%2276c0c8f4-8bff-d129-d3fc-e00cc981851a%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%2281c36707-403c-b927-25d3-58678d90ccb1%22%7D%5D\" href=\"/ela-curriculum-pilot\" class=\"button w-button\">Learn more</a></div></div><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6751e31f9aaa082b0f7234ec/69b40c0f3f648f15414aadd1_Paired%20Texts.png\" loading=\"lazy\" id=\"w-node-_76c0c8f4-8bff-d129-d3fc-e00cc981852b-c981851a\" alt=\"Three paired texts about Rosie the Riveter with images: women in military uniforms, soldiers boarding a landing craft in World War II, and two soldiers training with one carrying the other.\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 48vw, (max-width: 991px) 356px, 462px\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6751e31f9aaa082b0f7234ec/69b40c0f3f648f15414aadd1_Paired%20Texts-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6751e31f9aaa082b0f7234ec/69b40c0f3f648f15414aadd1_Paired%20Texts-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6751e31f9aaa082b0f7234ec/69b40c0f3f648f15414aadd1_Paired%20Texts-p-1080.png 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6751e31f9aaa082b0f7234ec/69b40c0f3f648f15414aadd1_Paired%20Texts.png 1302w\" class=\"waves-image-features-9\"/></div></div></div><div class=\"waves---section-medium-7\"><div class=\"waves---main-container-7 w-container\"><div class=\"w-layout-grid waves---grid-image-halves-4\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6751e31f9aaa082b0f7234ec/67a3f0fc42f4c2af7e2028df_PD%20(1).avif\" loading=\"lazy\" id=\"w-node-d986202f-127a-1b64-70f2-6a16e769ee3a-e769ee37\" alt=\"\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 48vw, (max-width: 991px) 356px, 462px\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6751e31f9aaa082b0f7234ec/67a3f0fc42f4c2af7e2028df_PD%20(1)-p-500.avif 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6751e31f9aaa082b0f7234ec/67a3f0fc42f4c2af7e2028df_PD%20(1)-p-800.avif 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6751e31f9aaa082b0f7234ec/67a3f0fc42f4c2af7e2028df_PD%20(1)-p-1080.avif 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6751e31f9aaa082b0f7234ec/67a3f0fc42f4c2af7e2028df_PD%20(1)-p-1600.avif 1600w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6751e31f9aaa082b0f7234ec/67a3f0fc42f4c2af7e2028df_PD%20(1)-p-2000.png 2000w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6751e31f9aaa082b0f7234ec/67a3f0fc42f4c2af7e2028df_PD%20(1)-p-2600.png 2600w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6751e31f9aaa082b0f7234ec/67a3f0fc42f4c2af7e2028df_PD%20(1)-p-3200.png 3200w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6751e31f9aaa082b0f7234ec/67a3f0fc42f4c2af7e2028df_PD%20(1).avif 4113w\" class=\"waves-image-features-10\"/><div id=\"w-node-d986202f-127a-1b64-70f2-6a16e769ee3b-e769ee37\" class=\"waves---content-image-halves-4\"><h3 class=\"u-text-family-secondary\">Professional development for educators</h3><div><div class=\"u-text-align-left u-text-large\">Our curriculum-based professional learning is built around the curriculum your teachers use every day. Sessions are virtual, in person, or on demand, and led by former teachers.<br/></div><a data-wf-native-id-path=\"25630e35-d0a3-d753-f53b-6b49a162c303:14daee58-90c0-a6f0-a8e6-03ac646895d7\" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking=\"true\" data-wf-element-id=\"14daee58-90c0-a6f0-a8e6-03ac646895d7\" data-wf-component-context=\"%5B%7B%22componentId%22%3A%22d986202f-127a-1b64-70f2-6a16e769ee37%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%2225630e35-d0a3-d753-f53b-6b49a162c303%22%7D%5D\" href=\"/professional-development\" class=\"button w-button\">Learn more</a></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"waves---section-medium-7\"><div class=\"waves---main-container-7 w-container\"><div class=\"w-layout-grid waves---grid-image-halves-4\"><div id=\"w-node-de2f2659-d57f-3c79-f1f0-6581385602de-385602db\" class=\"waves---content-image-halves-4\"><h3 class=\"u-text-family-secondary\">Assessments and data you can use</h3><div><div class=\"u-text-large left-align\">Our three benchmark assessments track reading growth across the school year. Clear results show you where students are and what to teach next.</div><a data-wf-native-id-path=\"1a289d61-76d4-0568-348c-8fb813d8163c:5ff28e90-92a4-61e1-064c-577f1550adb9\" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking=\"true\" data-wf-element-id=\"5ff28e90-92a4-61e1-064c-577f1550adb9\" data-wf-component-context=\"%5B%7B%22componentId%22%3A%22de2f2659-d57f-3c79-f1f0-6581385602db%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%221a289d61-76d4-0568-348c-8fb813d8163c%22%7D%5D\" href=\"/benchmark-assessments\" class=\"button w-button\">Learn more</a></div></div><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6751e31f9aaa082b0f7234ec/687943bb0cb6afb9c9bf53e3_Assessments-Abstraction-2.avif\" loading=\"lazy\" id=\"w-node-de2f2659-d57f-3c79-f1f0-6581385602ec-385602db\" alt=\"\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6751e31f9aaa082b0f7234ec/687943bb0cb6afb9c9bf53e3_Assessments-Abstraction-2-p-500.avif 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6751e31f9aaa082b0f7234ec/687943bb0cb6afb9c9bf53e3_Assessments-Abstraction-2-p-800.avif 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6751e31f9aaa082b0f7234ec/687943bb0cb6afb9c9bf53e