on-subhead add-on-override\"><p class=\"u-text-large-copy u-text-align-left\">Our team of curriculum writers have carefully developed CommonLit 360 to align with four guiding principles, ensuring that each unit and lesson are designed to support the growth and success of all learners.</p></div></div><div class=\"button-wrapper\"><a data-margin-top=\"small\" data-wf-native-id-path=\"f78e2dfc-f21d-9d38-834c-a160557516c0:aab77268-acd3-7a7e-2326-652546bb5a8b\" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking=\"true\" data-wf-element-id=\"aab77268-acd3-7a7e-2326-652546bb5a8b\" data-wf-component-context=\"%5B%7B%22componentId%22%3A%22aab77268-acd3-7a7e-2326-652546bb5a7b%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%22f78e2dfc-f21d-9d38-834c-a160557516c0%22%7D%5D\" href=\"/ela-teacher-resources\" class=\"button button-inline-blk w-inline-block\"><div class=\"text-block-31\">Learn more</div></a></div></div><div class=\"pilot-add-on-column-2\"><div class=\"pilot-add-on-wrapper gp1\"><div class=\"pilot-add-on-decoration\"></div><div id=\"w-node-aab77268-acd3-7a7e-2326-652546bb5a92-46bb5a7b\" class=\"pilot-add-on-content\"><div class=\"pilot-add-on-colulmn-1\"><h3 class=\"guiding-principles\">Students can engage with and learn rigorous, grade-level content</h3></div></div></div><div data-w-id=\"f0856cfa-5bed-fff9-bb51-c70b552b8d85\" class=\"pilot-add-on-wrapper gp2 gp1\"><div class=\"pilot-add-on-decoration\"></div><div id=\"w-node-f0856cfa-5bed-fff9-bb51-c70b552b8d88-46bb5a7b\" class=\"pilot-add-on-content\"><div class=\"pilot-add-on-colulmn-1\"><h3 class=\"guiding-principles\">Teachers drive student outcomes</h3></div></div></div><div data-w-id=\"9ef981d6-daab-a1df-19ba-4ec40975c433\" class=\"pilot-add-on-wrapper gp3 gp1\"><div class=\"pilot-add-on-decoration\"></div><div id=\"w-node-_9ef981d6-daab-a1df-19ba-4ec40975c436-46bb5a7b\" class=\"pilot-add-on-content\"><div class=\"pilot-add-on-colulmn-1\"><h3 class=\"guiding-principles\">Deep engagement fosters deep learning</h3></div></div></div><div data-w-id=\"bb6eaecb-49a1-7e47-da41-e50cf6974893\" class=\"pilot-add-on-wrapper gp4 gp1\"><div class=\"pilot-add-on-decoration\"></div><div id=\"w-node-bb6eaecb-49a1-7e47-da41-e50cf6974896-46bb5a7b\" class=\"pilot-add-on-content\"><div class=\"pilot-add-on-colulmn-1\"><h3 class=\"guiding-principles\">Learning is fundamentally social</h3></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"waves---section-medium-5\"><div class=\"waves---main-container-4 w-container\"><div class=\"w-layout-grid waves---grid-image-halves-2\"><div id=\"w-node-_54616b70-ef77-2eff-fb00-d79d4fc20f7c-4fc20f79\" class=\"waves---content-image-halves-2\"><h2>Based on evidence, built for impact</h2><div class=\"text-block-26\">Everything we build is grounded in research and shaped by real classroom results. </div><div class=\"waves---mg-top-18\"><a data-wf-native-id-path=\"185ebf99-c347-51e5-9f7d-bc7a25b28586:54616b70-ef77-2eff-fb00-d79d4fc20f82\" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking=\"true\" data-wf-element-id=\"54616b70-ef77-2eff-fb00-d79d4fc20f82\" data-wf-component-context=\"%5B%7B%22componentId%22%3A%2254616b70-ef77-2eff-fb00-d79d4fc20f79%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%22185ebf99-c347-51e5-9f7d-bc7a25b28586%22%7D%5D\" href=\"/impact\" class=\"button w-button\">See our impact</a></div></div><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6751e31f9aaa082b0f7234ec/67a3c11184531eaf001c9fb7_Frame%202%20(6).avif\" loading=\"lazy\" id=\"w-node-_54616b70-ef77-2eff-fb00-d79d4fc20f84-4fc20f79\" sizes=\"100vw\" alt=\"EdReports logo and ESSA Evidence badges from Instructure.\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6751e31f9aaa082b0f7234ec/67a3c11184531eaf001c9fb7_Frame%202%20(6)-p-500.avif 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6751e31f9aaa082b0f7234ec/67a3c11184531eaf001c9fb7_Frame%202%20(6).avif 1908w\" class=\"waves-image-features-7\"/></div></div></div><div class=\"testimonials_section u-vflex-center-center\"><div data-padding-bottom=\"large\" data-padding-top=\"large\" class=\"testimonials_contain u-columns-10 u-vflex-center-top\"><div class=\"section_intro-center-aligned\"><div class=\"section_intro-section-label\"><div class=\"u-text-section-label u-text-align-center\">TESTIMONIALS</div></div><div class=\"section_intro-title\"><h2 class=\"u-text-h2 u-text-align-center\"><strong>Loved by teachers, trusted by administrators</strong></h2></div><div class=\"section-subhead\"><p data-hs-ignore=\"true\" class=\"u-text-large u-text-align-center\">Get inspired by the experiences of educators who’ve seen the impact of our program.</p></div></div><div class=\"testimonials_slider-wrap u-width-full u-position-relative\"><div data-delay=\"4000\" data-animation=\"slide\" class=\"testimonials_slider-component w-slider\" data-autoplay=\"false\" data-easing=\"ease-in-out-cubic\" data-hide-arrows=\"false\" data-disable-swipe=\"false\" data-w-id=\"7e9f79e4-09b8-cce0-fe76-81ccb6ee77ad\" data-autoplay-limit=\"0\" data-nav-spacing=\"3\" data-duration=\"1200\" data-infinite=\"true\"><div class=\"testimonials_slider-mask w-slider-mask\"><div class=\"testimonials_slider-slide u-relative w-slide\"><div class=\"testimonials_slider-slide-content u-hflex-between-stretch u-radius-main\"><div class=\"testimonials_slider-slide-left u-columns-6 overflow-hidden\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6751e31f9aaa082b0f7234ec/678978d93ba69b6a37e3ec51_CL-Testimonials-01%403x.avif\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Two teachers completing a CommonLit Professional Development module on a laptop.\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6751e31f9aaa082b0f7234ec/678978d93ba69b6a37e3ec51_CL-Testimonials-01%403x-p-500.avif 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6751e31f9aaa082b0f7234ec/678978d93ba69b6a37e3ec51_CL-Testimonials-01%403x-p-800.avif 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6751e31f9aaa082b0f7234ec/678978d93ba69b6a37e3ec51_CL-Testimonials-01%403x.avif 960w\" class=\"u-img-cover\"/></div><div role=\"blockquote\" class=\"testimonials_slider-slide-right u-columns-6 u-vflex-left-between u-bg-ppr-white-300 u-padding-inset\"><div class=\"testimonials_slider-quote u-zindex-1\"><div role=\"\" class=\"testimonials_quote\">&quot;CommonLit has been a game changer. It provides a common language for teachers. The Professional Development is intentionally designed, and we’ve had more buy-in and success than we ever envisioned. We’ve even seen the level of instructional conversations increase across the district.&quot;</div></div><div class=\"testimonials_slider-quote-attribute u-vflex-left-top u-zindex-1\"><div class=\"quote-name\">Angela Szakasits</div><div class=\"quote-title\">Secondary Instructional Coach ELA</div><div class=\"quote-school\">Pender County Schools, NC</div></div></div><div class=\"testimonials_slider-spine\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6751e31f9aaa082b0f7234ec/6751e31f9aaa082b0f723520_commonlit-web-illustration-spine.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" class=\"img-spiral\"/></div></div></div><div class=\"testimonials_slider-slide u-relative w-slide\"><div class=\"testimonials_slider-slide-content u-hflex-between-stretch u-radius-main\"><div class=\"testimonials_slider-slide-left u-columns-6 overflow-hidden\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6751e31f9aaa082b0f7234ec/678978d9cacaa674fbe0c21f_CL-Testimonials-02%403x.avif\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Students completing CommonLit 360 lessons on their computers.\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6751e31f9aaa082b0f7234ec/678978d9cacaa674fbe0c21f_CL-Testimonials-02%403x-p-500.avif 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6751e31f9aaa082b0f7234ec/678978d9cacaa674fbe0c21f_CL-Testimonials-02%403x-p-800.avif 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6751e31f9aaa082b0f7234ec/678978d9cacaa674fbe0c21f_CL-Testimonials-02%403x.avif 960w\" class=\"u-img-cover\"/></div><div role=\"blockquote\" class=\"testimonials_slider-slide-right u-columns-6 u-vflex-left-between u-bg-ppr-white-300 u-padding-inset\"><div class=\"testimonials_slider-quote u-zindex-1\"><div class=\"testimonials_quote\">&quot;Planning is so much easier, because now I’m not searching for something that matches the standard. CommonLit already aligns to the standard. By far, my lesson planning and data collection has been so much better than it’s ever been in the past. It’s because it’s all right there for you.&quot;</div></div><div class=\"testimonials_slider-quote-attribute u-vflex-left-top u-zindex-1\"><div class=\"quote-name\">Sarah Johnson</div><div class=\"quote-title\">Literacy Coach for Grades 7-12</div><div>Lakewood Middle School, NJ</div></div></div><div class=\"testimonials_slider-spine\"><div class=\"testimonials_slider-spine\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6751e31f9aaa082b0f7234ec/6751e31f9aaa082b0f723520_commonlit-web-illustration-spine.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" class=\"img-spiral\"/></div></div></div></div><div class=\"testimonials_slider-slide u-relative w-slide\"><div class=\"testimonials_slider-slide-content u-hflex-between-stretch u-radius-main\"><div class=\"testimonials_slider-slide-left u-columns-6 overflow-hidden\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6751e31f9aaa082b0f7234ec/678978d9deab389fa26cc85b_CL-Testimonials-03%403x.avif\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Two students smiling while working together on a CommonLit 360 lesson.\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6751e31f9aaa082b0f7234ec/678978d9deab389fa26cc85b_CL-Testimonials-03%403x-p-500.avif 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6751e31f9aaa082b0f7234ec/678978d9deab389fa26cc85b_CL-Testimonials-03%403x-p-800.avif 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6751e31f9aaa082b0f7234ec/678978d9deab389fa26cc85b_CL-Testimonials-03%403x.avif 960w\" class=\"u-img-cover\"/></div><div role=\"blockquote\" class=\"testimonials_slider-slide-right u-columns-6 u-vflex-left-between u-bg-ppr-white-300 u-padding-inset\"><div class=\"testimonials_slider-quote u-zindex-1\"><div class=\"testimonials_quote\">&quot;I was blown away with the opportunities CommonLit afforded our teachers to diversify what they were offering to students in their classrooms.&quot;</div></div><div class=\"testimonials_slider-quote-attribute u-vflex-left-top u-zindex-1\"><div class=\"quote-name\">Tracy Hunt</div><div class=\"quote-title\">Instructional Facilitator for ELA/Media</div><div class=\"quote-school\">Mid-Del School District</div></div></div><div class=\"testimonials_slider-spine\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6751e31f9aaa082b0f7234ec/6751e31f9aaa082b0f723520_commonlit-web-illustration-spine.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" class=\"img-spiral\"/></div></div></div></div><div class=\"testimonials_slider-arrow hide-mobile-landscape w-slider-arrow-left\"><div class=\"testimonials_slider-arrow-icon w-embed\"><svg width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<path d=\"M3.31066 8.75001L9.03033 14.4697L7.96967 15.5303L0.439339 8.00001L7.96967 0.469676L9.03033 1.53034L3.31066 7.25001L15.5 7.25L15.5 8.75L3.31066 8.75001Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/>\n</svg></div></div><div class=\"testimonials_slider-arrow w-slider-arrow-right\"><div class=\"testimonials_slider-arrow-icon w-embed\"><svg width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<path d=\"M12.6893 7.25L6.96967 1.53033L8.03033 0.469666L15.5607 8L8.03033 15.5303L6.96967 14.4697L12.6893 8.75H0.5V7.25H12.6893Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/>\n</svg></div></div><div class=\"testimonials_slider-slide-nav w-slider-nav w-slider-nav-invert w-round\"></div></div><div data-w-id=\"cad8e07d-2a59-e22f-f5c1-622c162670d7\" class=\"testimonials_doodle-arrow\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"divider-solid-section-break-container\"><div class=\"divider-solid-section-break\"></div></div><div class=\"waves---section-medium-10\"><div class=\"section_intro-center-aligned\"><h2 class=\"waves---heading-2-no-margins-8\"><strong class=\"bold-text-7\">Case studies</strong></h